        parent=dict(path=str(path),sha256=digest),challenge_parent=parent['challenge_parent'],records=records,noise_controls=controls,challenges=challenges,
        dependencies={n:sha256(ROOT/'tests'/n) for n in ('study_noise_collaborative_wiener.py','study_noise_sure_feasibility.py','study_noise_semantic_comparison.py','study_noise_patch_aggregation.py','study_noise_connected_reconstruction.py')},
        rules='One replacement only:groupDCTcoefficient[spatial0,group0] becomes pilotDC,notgain*rawDC. Othercoefficients/orderedgroups/Wienergains/aggregation unchanged. Exact correction(guideDC-gDC*rawDC)/sqrt425 appliedtoparent output;truthcomponent correction uses denoisedpilotSIGNALfromsameobservedNLMweights,notcleantruthDC. Parent immutable and reused ascomparators,notlegacyprodpath. Pairedoffset0/5/20 foreachfreshfield,translationassert1e-7 fornewvariants.108freshforms+32freshflatfields+9knownchallenges=149basefields447relatedstates. Common24core,picsatreal sampledposition,totalvscontrastsignalprojections separated. No fittedcoefficient ornewSUREselector.',
